OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud with outbreaks of light
OL,6,Frain possible through this morning.
OL,7,FTurning drier through the afternoon
OL,8,Fbut remaining rather cloudy. Feeling
OL,9,Fchilly with a southeasterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA chilly night to come, with
OL,12,Fhigh cloud allowing temperatures to
OL,13,Fdrop off. A frost may develop in prone
OL,14,Flocations, elsewhere remaining just
OL,15,Fabove freezing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA brighter start on
OL,18,FWednesday, though this sunshine will
OL,19,Fbe hazy. Feeling chillier than Tuesday
OL,20,Fbut remaining dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
