OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells on Thursday, before turning wet
OL,7,Fand windy from the west into Friday
OL,8,Fmorning. Turning drier by afternoon
OL,9,Fand into Saturday before rain returns
OL,10,Flater. Chilly overnight with frost.
